# kiwi: fingerprint (route A).
#
# qseecomd loads cmnlib and the TrustZone apps from a hard-coded
# /firmware/image path, which is a symlink to /vendor/odm/modem.
# Following a rootfs symlink needs read + search on rootfs.
#
# NOT a domain definition: qseecomd still runs in init's domain (init
# logs 'no domain transition'). That is a separate piece of work; while
# the device is permissive it changes nothing either way.
allow init rootfs:lnk_file { read getattr };
